<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Blogs on TenStrokeTalk</title><link>https://tenstroketalk.com/blog/</link><description>Recent content in Blogs on TenStrokeTalk</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>Copyright &amp;copy; 2026 by TenStrokeTalk.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sun, 15 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://tenstroketalk.com/blog/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>OpenWRT 旁路由部署 Tailscale 实践</title><link>https://tenstroketalk.com/blog/tailscale-deployment-on-openwrt-secondary-router/</link><pubDate>Sun, 15 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tenstroketalk.com/blog/tailscale-deployment-on-openwrt-secondary-router/</guid><description>OpenWRT 作为针对路由器等嵌入式设备设计的基于 Linux 的开源操作系统，因其较低的硬件配置需求和广泛的开源社区支持获得了许多技术爱好者的青睐。在家庭网络部署中，为了不修改网络原本的拓扑，可以将 OpenWRT 部署在老旧的 ARM 或者 X86 设备上作为「旁路网关」使用。</description></item><item><title>NUC 9 AIO 再折腾</title><link>https://tenstroketalk.com/blog/nuc-9-aio-retinkering/</link><pubDate>Sat, 14 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tenstroketalk.com/blog/nuc-9-aio-retinkering/</guid><description>两年时间，发现自己在 AIO 上折腾下的功夫远超我日常使用需要，这次索性一步到位配一台「退烧机」，彻底满足我对「小体积、全闪存、配备显卡」的需求，同时保证长期稳定性，因此软硬件部署都做了一些改动。</description></item><item><title>NUC 11 AIO 折腾小记</title><link>https://tenstroketalk.com/blog/nuc-11-aio-tinkering/</link><pubDate>Tue, 23 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tenstroketalk.com/blog/nuc-11-aio-tinkering/</guid><description>这是一份做了五个月的作业，花费了不少时间、精力、金钱，写在这里做个记录。</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tenstroketalk.com/blog/nuc-11-aio-tinkering/featured.jpg"/></item></channel></rss>